  title=m.data.shop?'구입 확인':'보상 상세';content=`<div class="offer-detail-hero"><span class="offer-art" aria-hidden="true">${offerArt(offer)}</span><div class="offer-detail-copy"><h3>${esc(offerTitle(offer))}</h3>${offer.kind==='evolve'?`<p class="role-headline">${esc(roleHeadlines[offer.type]||roles[offer.type])}</p>`:offer.kind==='recruit'?`<p class="role-headline">${esc(roleHeadlines[offer.type]||roles[offer.type]||'신병 모집')}</p>`:''}<span class="tag">${esc(offerMeta(offer))}</span></div></div>${m.data.shop?`<div class="shop-confirm-wallet"><span>${metricIcon('gold',24)}보유 <strong>${number(run.gold)}G</strong></span><span>상품 가격 <strong>${number(purchasePreview.price)}G</strong></span><span class="shop-gold-after">${purchasePreview.purchased?'이미 구입한 상품':purchasePreview.gold.after<0?`필요한 골드 ${number(-purchasePreview.gold.after)}G 부족`:`구입 후 남는 골드 <strong>${number(purchasePreview.gold.after)}G</strong>`}</span></div>${purchasePreview.disabled?`<p class="risk-box shop-product-status is-blocked" id="shopUnavailableReason">${metricIcon('lock')}${esc(purchasePreview.disabledReason)}</p>`:''}`:''}`;
